cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this pipeline, its stored corpora, or its gate reports, please
  cite this repository. The manuscripts it produces are not yet published, so
  there is no journal reference to cite instead.
title: >-
  Automated perovskite photovoltaics literature review: a validator-gated
  pipeline at monthly, half-year, and yearly cadence
abstract: >-
  A staged pipeline that turns a scholarly-database query into a review
  manuscript, where a language model writes prose and extracts values and
  deterministic scripts decide whether that output may ship. Seventeen gates
  compute over stored JSON, no gate consults a model, and the model that
  reviews an output is never the model that produced it. This repository holds
  the code, the stored run artifacts for eleven runs, the gate reports
  including the failing ones, and the rendered documents, so results can be
  re-verified offline without re-running any paid API or model call.
type: software
